---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Mark from "../components/Mark.astro";
import icon from "../../../gui/src-tauri/icons/src/mandala-glass.svg";
import { INSTALL, REPO, TAGLINE } from "../site";

// The six state words, in the order the app lists them.
const words = [
  ["busy", "忙碌"],
  ["blocked", "待批"],
  ["done", "完成"],
  ["errored", "中断"],
  ["failed", "失败"],
  ["idle", "空闲"],
];
---

<Base>
  <header class="bar">
    <Mark />
    <nav>
      <a class="bar-link" href="/docs/">文档</a>
      <a class="bar-link" href={REPO}>GitHub</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="home">
    <section class="hero">
      <img src={icon.src} alt="" width="96" height="96" />
      <h1>khor</h1>
      <p class="tagline">{TAGLINE}</p>
      <div class="cmd">
        <span class="cmd-prompt">$</span>
        <code id="install">{INSTALL}</code>
        <button class="btn" type="button" data-copy="install">复制</button>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">Linux 与 macOS，不需要 root</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/docs/install/">开始使用</a>
    </section>

    <section class="grid3">
      <div class="group">
        <h2>一张网，没有中心</h2>
        <p>每台机器既是客户端也是服务器。配对任意一台就入网，数据只在你自己的设备之间流动；中继只转发，不存内容</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group">
        <h2>所有会话，一个列表</h2>
        <p>shell、智能体、对话、文件传输在同一个列表里，用同一套状态词</p>
        <ul class="words">
          {words.map(([key, word]) => <li style={`color: var(--state-${key})`}>{word}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="group">
        <h2>命令行与界面等价</h2>
        <p>同一个后端。界面上能做的，命令行都能做</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2 class="section-title">三步</h2>
    <section class="group rows">
      <div class="row">
        <span class="row-n">1</span>
        <div>
          <h3>安装</h3>
          <p>每台设备上跑一遍，装完它就常驻</p>
          <pre><code>{INSTALL}</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <span class="row-n">2</span>
        <div>
          <h3>入网</h3>
          <p>在已经装好的那台上出一张票，在新机器上用掉它。票 15 分钟内有效，只能用一次</p>
          <pre><code>khor invite
khor pair &lt;票&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <span class="row-n">3</span>
        <div>
          <h3>打开</h3>
          <p>发一个链接，拿手机或者别的电脑打开，就是整张网</p>
          <pre><code>khor web</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2 class="section-title">能做什么</h2>
    <section class="group rows features">
      <div class="row">
        <h3>监控</h3>
        <p>每台机器的 CPU、GPU、内存、磁盘，每个会话的状态</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <h3>发起</h3>
        <p>在任意一台设备上开会话、传文件、借另一台机器的网</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <h3>智能体</h3>
        <p>Claude Code、Codex 的会话装上就出现在列表里；有动作等你准许的排在最前</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <h3>网页脸</h3>
        <p>任一台机器出一张网页，手机上什么都不用装</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="foot">
      <span>坛城（Kyil-khor），意为连接</span>
      <nav>
        <a href="/docs/">文档</a>
        <a href={REPO}>GitHub</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Base>

<script>
  for (const button of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-copy]")) {
    button.addEventListener("click", async () => {
      const source = document.getElementById(button.dataset.copy!);
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(source?.textContent ?? "");
      button.textContent = "已复制";
      setTimeout(() => (button.textContent = "复制"), 1600);
    });
  }
</script>
